[sliver] Required graphic outlines: these strips are the raised sides of the frame, divider, QR and letter outlines, plus the divider's fine front face. Their dimensions follow the artwork master and the plate's shared scale. Derek approved the resized plate's appearance.
alternatives: Wider frame and divider strokes change the requested light border. Removing the raised side faces requires flush artwork; larger letterforms spend the balanced spacing to the identification lines and QR.
